  refine specR_loadI' swU _ (P + 8) (P + BitVec.ofNat 64 8) (Enc.idxW us) (by decide) (by simp +decide [sev]) rfl
    (by simpa [encEView, Enc.encConst] using wordsAt_mem1 P (Enc.idxW c) (Enc.idxW us) [] []) ?_
